--short","description":"git diff --check && git diff -- README.md CHANGELOG.md && git status --short"}},"result":{"type":"tool_result","content":"{\"type\":\"bash_output\",\"pending\":false,\"command\":\"git diff --check && git diff -- README.md CHANGELOG.md && git status --short\",\"description\":\"git diff --check && git diff -- README.md CHANGELOG.md && git status --short\",\"content\":\"diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md\\nindex 07dbbd1..5d24d32 100644\\n--- a/CHANGELOG.md\\n+++ b/CHANGELOG.md\\n@@ -12,3 +12,4 @@\\n - `.agents/setup` no longer runs a `generate` script the project doesn''t have, so setup succeeds again.\\n - `.agents/setup` drops the `npm run generate` line that came back in 59b14d0; the project has no `generate` script, so setup failed with \\\"Missing script\\\".\\n - `README.md` says small pull requests are welcome.\\n+- `README.md` includes a retry example with a custom `maxMs`.\\ndiff --git a/README.md b/README.md\\nindex 508a4c3..401aafd 100644\\n--- a/README.md\\n+++ b/README.md\\n@@ -6,4 +6,14 @@\\n - `.agents/setup` installs and builds; `.agents/resume` checks GitHub access and fetches when a stopped VM wakes; `.agents/archive` cleans up when a thread is archived (here it only removes a marker setup left).\\n - `.agents/services.yml` declares the services Flotilla runs in each thread''s VM: `web` serves the Retry visualizer, and `info` answers with JSON that says where `web` is.\\n \\n+## Usage\\n+\\n+```ts\\n+import { retry } from \\\"./src/retry\\\";\\n+\\n+const response = await retry(() => fetch(\\\"https://example.com/api\\\"), 5, 100, 500);\\n+```\\n+\\n+This retries up to five times with 100 ms base waits capped at a custom `maxMs` of 500 ms.\\n+\\n Small pull requests are welcome.\\n M CHANGELOG.md\\n M README.md\\n\",\"error\":false}","is_error":false,"tool_use_id":"call_8b06f9b6f3854bada82d1c92771e60df"}}],"is_reverted":false},"conversationId":"75201754-7ddc-4739-b68c-17587c4290d0"}', 1, '2026-11-01T02:05:16.011Z');
